  "id": "mediterranean-grilled-pork-chops",
  "name": "Mediterranean Grilled Pork Chops",
  "subtitle": "Herb-seasoned bone-in chops from the grill",
  "description": "Pork rib chops are coated with olive oil and a savory blend of sage, rosemary, thyme, fennel, and bay before grilling.",
